  unitName: Plunderer Verica
  unitId: 20062
  unitNumber: 82
  description: A pirate captain active in the seas near the ruined Sama Kingdom.
    His huge body and handsome beard awed those who stood before him. He spoke much
    softer than he looked, and his navigation log states that he maintained a peaceful
    ship. However, he was a demon in battle. He was so strong that whole navies would
    flee when they saw his flag.
  summonDesc: Freedom is the pirate's motto!<br>I'm free to help you, too!<br>On
    we go to treasure isle!
  fusionDesc: I am a pirate captain!<br>Behold, my burly strength!
  evoDesc: Even as captain, I am me!<br>I'll cut foes in half while I sing and dance!
  element: 2
  rarity: 2
